<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Assistance Hub Digital Online Services. Submit an application and learn about available online services.">
<title>Assistance Hub Digital Online Services</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6fb;color:#202b3c;line-height:1.6}
header{background:#123b70;color:white;text-align:center;padding:30px 16px}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:27px}
header p{margin:8px 0 0}
main{max-width:720px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 14px}
.card{background:white;padding:22px;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 3px 14px #102e5010}
h2{color:#123b70;margin-top:0}
label{display:block;font-weight:bold;margin:13px 0 5px}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:16px}
button{width:100%;padding:13px;background:#126bdf;color:white;border:0;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:18px}
.note{background:#eef5ff;padding:13px;border-radius:8px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:22px;color:#586579;font-size:14px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>Assistance Hub</h1>
<p>Digital Online Services</p>
<p>Simple, clear and reliable online assistance</p>
</header>
<main>
<section class="card">
<h2>Welcome</h2>
<p>Explore our online assistance information and submit an application for review. Submitting an application does not guarantee qualification, employment, income or approval.</p>
<div class="note"><strong>Important:</strong> Any registration fee must be clearly explained before payment. Do not send money until the service, fee and payment recipient have been independently verified.</div>
</section>
<section class="card">
<h2>Applicant Registration</h2>
<form id="applicationForm">
<label for="name">Full name *</label>
<input id="name" name="name" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="name">
<label for="email">Email address (optional)</label>
<input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email">
<label for="phone">Phone number *</label>
<input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required maxlength="20" autocomplete="tel">
<label for="service">Service you are interested in *</label>
<select id="service" name="service" required>
<option value="">Choose a service</option>
<option>Typing and document formatting</option>
<option>CV and application assistance</option>
<option>Data entry assistance</option>
<option>General online assistance</option>
</select>
<label for="details">Tell us briefly what assistance you need *</label>
<textarea id="details" name="details" rows="4" required maxlength="1000"></textarea>
<label><input type="checkbox" required style="width:auto"> I confirm that the information provided is accurate and agree to be contacted about my application.</label>
<button type="submit">Prepare Application</button>
</form>
<p id="result" role="status"></p>
<p class="note">Privacy: This demo does not transmit or save your application to a server. Do not enter passwords, PINs or sensitive personal information.</p>
</section>
<section class="card">
<h2>How qualification works</h2>
<ol>
<li>Complete the application form.</li>
<li>Your application must be reviewed by an authorised person.</li>
<li>Any decision and applicable service terms should be communicated clearly.</li>
</ol>
<p>No job, earnings or approval is guaranteed.</p>
</section>
<section class="card">
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>For inquiries about services, contact the website administrator using a contact address you trust and control.</p>
<p><strong>Registration fee:</strong> No payment is collected on this demonstration website.</p>
</section>
</main>
<footer>© 2026 Assistance Hub Digital Online Services</footer>
<script>
document.getElementById('applicationForm').addEventListener('submit',function(e){
e.preventDefault();
document.getElementById('result').textContent='Your form has been checked in this browser, but it has NOT been sent or saved. Contact the administrator to arrange a secure submission method.';
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
